   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IATI- International Aid Transparency Initative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r en frivillig g&#xe5;va till IATI,det Internationella              Bist&#xe5;ndstransparensinitativet. IATI &#xe4;r ett initativ med m&#xe5;nga         intressenter och s&#xf6;ker att &#xf6;ka genomsynligheten f&#xf6;r bist&#xe5;nd i syfte   att &#xf6;ka dess effektivitet i att minska fattigdomen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a voluntary gift to IATI, the International Aid Transparency  Initative. IATI is a multi-stakeholder initiative that seeks to       improve the transparency of aid in order to increase its              effectiveness in tackling poverty.</narrative>
  </description>
